#: scenario5:scenario5_FD1E4CFA_CA65_45AD_AFB4_542C2A8574BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b2046c8daaa74ae3375b63ac756fd708f63f063fdb429284964ff9cbcb8ee10
